Package: libva-v4l2
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: va-driver
Description: VA-API backend for Qualcomm Iris stateful V4L2 devices
 Hardware video decoding through the Qualcomm Iris stateful V4L2 M2M
 interface, for SC8280XP (Radxa Dragon Q8B) and SM7475 (Xiaomi Poco F5 /
 Redmi Note 12 Turbo, marble). Requires a kernel whose Iris driver exposes
 the decoder display-delay controls (see the iris decode-order patch in
 linux-redmi-marble) and a matching firmware.
 .
 Includes the MSM driver alias and GStreamer VA environment configuration.
 FastCV video processing is disabled in distribution builds; H.264/HEVC
 encoding is untested on marble.
